{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46195","headline":"山居诗二十四首 九 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙藏琅函遍九垓，霜锺金鼓振琼台。\n堪嗟一句无人得，遂使吾师特地来。\n无角铁牛眠少室，生儿石女老黄梅。\n令人转忆庞居士，天上人间不可陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}